<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has expanded road networks and opened new bases in southern Lebanon while conducting airstrikes on Qantara and overflights that injured a Lebanese footballer and led to the detention of a 65‑year-old retired engineer. Hezbollah arrested five members in Batroun, continued artillery fire on Israeli positions, and began cash payments to war victims and displaced families. Former Iraqi MP Ahmed al-Alwani was killed in Beirut, prompting further updates. France opened a probe into alleged Israeli war crimes and protests against Israeli attacks occurred in Sweden. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE54R1pweUMtN1M4c0dTQ3NCLTQyUFFpWTVVeXZ5ZGhqUlNtSE9PV0xqWHBrTXRhOEwtaXU5aXdXd09KVmt0cXZ0Y2FVdjdCY0NLci0zS01lQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-treasury-chief-bessent-moved-to-military-base-after-iranian-threats-reports-say/article71688103.ece&quot;&gt;thehindu.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Malaysia Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPRm9mS2VDVlpxeEpzZWkxTG82UER2ZDBMMU9qTjJXbnRiUG5ZXzNxUk9uMDV6LWdrc0hrZ2VCaHdmdzAyMUZLUDZqQXlmYUxHWjU3cEFXVFlrdENWdU01dWpUZXAxRHIyTTBrd0dZc19ueUFjMDRwMzB2NXA0SVJPTHRvbTFna3BneEVfOFRhUTE2dGJYU3J2YjBFUFhUMzJTZjc2cw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News PK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPRTc2UmtUVWlERW1yakk5MW5LTDRXTWdWSkVyU1dIV2Rya19Fc0U4aVhzT0c0b1dqNmtianU4c3FkbU5hX1AwSDNtbkN6M1hUbkNKalhUaU1HYXVWT2Q5YVdfQWE0OGg5WC1Gd1pESDZLY2I2MU9xSFRCVTY5c29wRkZ